Sītā laments slain husband and Lakṣmaṇa --- Sītā calls fortune-tellers false --- Sītā lists body marks now falsified --- Sītā marvels divine weapons failed against māyā --- Sītā grieves most for waiting mother-in-law --- Trijaṭā bids Sītā trust husband lives --- Trijaṭā cites steady army and unfaded faces --- Sītā assents and returns to Aśōkavana